1
00:00:00,621 --> 00:00:03,181
Now let's turn a thought to a task.

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:05,721
So press Right Option key,

3
00:00:05,980 --> 00:00:08,381
say the request shown below and press the right

4
00:00:08,381 --> 00:00:09,740
option key again to submit.

5
00:00:09,820 --> 00:00:12,221
What this will do is this will create a new Claude

6
00:00:12,221 --> 00:00:14,461
or a Codex session based on whatever you selected,

7
00:00:15,101 --> 00:00:18,300
and it will send you a request as the input for that session.

8
00:00:18,780 --> 00:00:21,420
And you can just look at the notch at the top

9
00:00:21,821 --> 00:00:24,701
and your request would be in, sending state initially.

10
00:00:25,210 --> 00:00:26,170
Once the request is sent,

11
00:00:26,170 --> 00:00:28,931
you can open the chat box basically by tapping the

12
00:00:28,931 --> 00:00:32,970
notch and it will have your message as well as the model's response

13
00:00:33,290 --> 00:00:34,091
there itself.

14
00:00:34,651 --> 00:00:37,570
So this is a really easy way for you to trigger

15
00:00:37,570 --> 00:00:39,930
new tasks from anywhere across your Mac.

16
00:00:39,930 --> 00:00:42,731
You don't have to switch windows, you don't have to

17
00:00:43,610 --> 00:00:44,371
switch apps.

18
00:00:44,371 --> 00:00:45,850
And look for, you know,

19
00:00:45,930 --> 00:00:49,170
the terminal or where the Codex or Claude app is.

20
00:00:49,170 --> 00:00:50,011
You just have to.

21
00:00:50,250 --> 00:00:51,290
Well, if you had a thought,

22
00:00:51,290 --> 00:00:54,411
you just have to unmute yourself by pressing the Right Option key and

23
00:00:55,371 --> 00:00:56,570
say, what do you want to say?

24
00:00:56,570 --> 00:00:57,771
Capture whatever you want to capture.

25
00:00:57,771 --> 00:00:59,530
If it's a Slack link, if it's a Twitter link,

26
00:00:59,530 --> 00:01:01,811
